      "instance_name": "women_are_only_good_at_housework",
      "label": "Women Are Only Good at Housework",
      "description": "A stereotype that women are primarily suited for domestic tasks and caregiving roles, implying they lack competence or value in other areas. This is implicitly referenced in the meme by the humorous framing of the woman's pregnancy as the central focus, suggesting her identity is reduced to her reproductive state.",
