      "description": "The stereotype that women are emotionally unstable or overly dramatic, often used to dismiss their experiences or opinions. This is indirectly referenced in the meme through the exaggerated, absurd text 'i'm pregnant!!' which plays on the stereotype that women are overly emotional or dramatic about pregnancy.",
