      "label": "Goat is mapped as 'mom'",
      "description": "The text 'mom?' is overlaid on the image, humorously suggesting that the goat is being mistaken for the woman's mother. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual entity 'petting_goat' (the goat being petted) is mapped onto the textual entity 'mom?' as its role or identity in the absurd scenario.",
