      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the woman in the image",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the woman (VisualMaterial entity 'woman') as the subject of the meme's humor and the one experiencing the situation described by the text ('i'm pregnant!!'). The meme invites the user to imagine themselves in the role of the pregnant woman, making the absurd scenario personal and relatable. The text 'mom?' and 'i'm pregnant!!' are directed at the woman, implying the user sees themselves as the pregnant person in this scenario.",
