      "label": "Mysogynous",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that women are primarily defined by their reproductive roles, reinforcing the idea that a woman's value or identity is tied to her ability to bear children. This is manifested through the absurd juxtaposition of the woman being 'pregnant' and the goat being called 'mom', which reduces the woman to her maternal function.",
